From 6c8a9743bd289de4d6932a25dc0869806f0a4ba6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakompiled <itsrufer@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:52:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] runtime: GOAL processes on JSPI stacks

web/goal_kernel_web.cpp implements the jakompiled-* kernel primitives:
each process main thread runs on its own JSPI stack (and its own C
stack), the kernel suspends the EE thread while a process runs, and
return-from-thread, go and throw are C++ exceptions. Built with -sJSPI
and -fwasm-exceptions. Also converts the C functions registered through
make_func_symbol_func (common kmachine) to GOAL_C_FN adapters.
