 web/goal_kernel_web.cpp         | 300 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 web/goal_wasm_link.cpp          |   5 +-
 7 files changed, 428 insertions(+), 97 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 web/goal_kernel_web.cpp

